From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tiago Goncalves <27917082+tacosta@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:06:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 29/31] feat(qwen): enable dense MTP drafting

Add dense Qwen3.5 MTP loading and speculative execution with allocator peak checks, overflow handling, KV-only prompt absorption, suffix tap capture, and sampled-draft coupling tests.

Keep the normalized prompt-feature interface reusable by any drafter that consumes normalized rows. Register TF_MTP_TREES once on current main and describe its sampled-tree opt-in.

Repair the receipt runner monotonic timer import and cover its readiness timeout.
